<div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2 flex justify-between md:justify-center items-center">
<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 text-[12px] font-label-md tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1"><div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-700 animate-pulse"></div>Pending</span>
